<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Face Link</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_PACKAGE_TYPE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<!-- App Store Connect가 64비트 바이너리에 요구한다 (업로드 오류 90502). Xcode 템플릿에는 있지만 이 Info.plist는 직접 쓴 것이라 넣는다 -->
	<key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
	<array>
		<string>arm64</string>
	</array>
	<!-- 표준 암호화(HTTPS 등)만 쓴다. TestFlight 빌드마다 수출 규정 질문을 받지 않게 -->
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>전면 TrueDepth 카메라로 얼굴을 추적하고, 아이패드의 QR 코드를 찍습니다. 영상은 보내지 않고 표정과 머리 방향 수치만 보냅니다.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>설정에서 "소리 보내기"를 켜면 아이폰 마이크 소리를 같은 Wi-Fi의 아이패드(Broadcast)로 보냅니다. 녹음해 저장하지 않습니다.</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>같은 Wi-Fi의 아이패드(Broadcast)를 찾고 얼굴 수치를 보냅니다.</string>
	<key>NSBonjourServices</key>
	<array>
		<string>_facelink._udp</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>FaceLinkBuild</key>
	<dict>
		<key>Run</key>
		<string>$(FACELINK_BUILD_RUN)</string>
		<key>Branch</key>
		<string>$(FACELINK_BUILD_BRANCH)</string>
		<key>Commit</key>
		<string>$(FACELINK_BUILD_COMMIT)</string>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
